    "created_at": "2016-09-26T08:26:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T08:26:05Z",
    "body": "We could even leave it in the current place and later restructure the algorithm to not do any cross-process activity in synchronous manner. Queuing a task for an event would be sufficient bandaid for now.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
