    "created_at": "2016-09-26T14:39:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T14:39:40Z",
    "body": "In Firefox SharedWorkers are not out-of-process at the moment.  But if the intent of the spec is that they _could_ be, then the current language would indeed be somewhat problematic.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
