    "created_at": "2016-09-26T19:55:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T19:55:10Z",
    "body": "We already fire async events for `new Worker()`.  It would be nice to do the same for `new SharedWorker()`.  This has been a compat issue for Worker in the recent past, though:\n\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1260388\n\nAnd yes, I expect `SharedWorker` to run in a separate process from the window.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
